==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 250,000 and increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*1 [[Le'Grim]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 12~18.67 seconds<sup>360f~560f</sup>.
*4 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 58.67~61.33 seconds<sup>1,760f~1,840f</sup>.
*2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

